Total CP: Total Lings: {0}Total Price :  Total Reward: {0} STotal attack attempts per round : {0}Total triangles	: TrackResurrectionTrackedObjectTrackingEventHandler - Invalid EventType: TrailerTrain a Ling 1 time.Train a Lings 1 times.Train1Trainer Energy

Usage:
Trainer Energy is required to sign new Lings, perform Kuchiyose to enhance a Lingâ€™s maximum stats, and carry out other key activities.
Increasing Maximum Energy and Regeneration Rate:
To increase your maximum Energy Points and the rate of Energy regeneration per hour, you must gain Trainer Genestrength(GS).
Trainer Genestrength can be obtained by using a Trainer License, which is available through the gacha system or the NFT marketplace.

Example:
GS 1 = Maximum Energy: 240, Regeneration Rate: 10 Energy per hour
GS 2 = Maximum Energy: 480, Regeneration Rate: 20 Energy per hour
GS 3 = Maximum Energy: 720, Regeneration Rate: 30 Energy per hour
(and so on)Trainer Gene Strength influences the Lings' Gene Strength upon sign a new Lings and increases the probability of obtaining a Shining Lings.

<u>Formula</u>
Lings Gene Strength = Trainer Gene Strength
Lings Mixed AB Gene Strength = Average(Trainer A Gene Strength, Trainer B Gene Strength)
Chance to Evolve into a Shining Lings =
(average Trainer Gene Strength - 1 [rounded down]) Ã— 0.5 / (5 + (average Trainer Gene Strength - 1)) Ã— Trainer Gene Strength influences the Lings' Gene Strength upon sign a new Lings and increases the probability of obtaining a Shining Lings.

<u>Evolution Formula:</u>
 - Sign new Lings Gene Strength = Trainer Gene Strength
 - Lings Mixed AB Gene Strength = Average(Trainer A Gene Strength,   - Trainer B Gene Strength)
 - Chance to Evolve into a Shining Lings =
(average Trainer Gene Strength - 1 [rounded down]) Ã— 0.5 / (5 + (average Trainer Gene Strength - 1)) Ã— 100%
<u>Examples</u>
Pure Gene Lings Evolution:

Trainerâ€™s Gene Strength = 2
Chance of evolving into a Shining Lings = 7%
Mixed Gene Lings Evolution (Trainer A: 1, Trainer B: 2):

Average Trainer Gene Strength = (1+2)/2 = 1.5, rounded down to 1
Chance of evolving into a Shining Lings = 0%
Mixed Gene Lings Evolution (Trainer A: 1, Trainer B: 3):

